  "body": "What happens: the AI chat panel offers local models a core set of 25 tools. It has no `rename_operation`, `edit_tool` or `set_work_material`. In the local-model MCP benchmark of 2026-11-22, \"rename an operation\" failed on all 12 models (four large ones said they could not do it), and spindle-speed and material requests could not be done cleanly.\n\nExpected: these three tools are in the core set (or the panel can ask for a wider set), with their schemas.\n\nDone means: the three tools are offered in native-tools mode; a panel test lists them; the benchmark's rename task can pass.\n",
